pack installation
├── when formatting receipt timestamps
│   ├── it renders the unix epoch
│   ├── it renders a modern date with time of day
│   └── it renders a leap day
├── when computing the manifest closure
│   ├── it lists the manifest query and template
│   ├── it includes a wasm grammar file
│   └── it omits the query for a lexical pack
└── when recognising staging suffixes
    ├── it accepts a pid seq tag
    └── it rejects a dotted pack name tail
